[6229]="7000F2FE\n1\tTalk to Reginald Ward\tReginald Ward can be found in Sûri-kylä in Forochel. You were instructed to seek out the captain of the Lost Fellowship, Reginald Ward.\n",
[6230]="7002CBD8\n1\tDeliver the knotted heartwood to any task-board in Great River\030Collect knotted heartwood (quantity: see journal)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire knotted heartwood.\n",
[6231]="7002CBDE\n1\tDeliver the thick branches to any task-board in Great River\030Collect thick branches (total: 3)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire thick branches.\n",
[6232]="7001757A\n1\tDefeat Longpincer\tLongpincer is in Skûmfil, east of the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone. Valthor has asked you to complete the Path of the Martial Champion by slaying the grodbog Longpincer.\n2\tTalk to Valthor at the Shadowed Refuge\tValthor is at the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone, west from Skûmfil. You should return to Valthor with news of your victory.\n",
[6233]="700321C0\n1\tIf you are done with the East Wall and have not yet visited the Wold, travel to Langhold, in the Wold\030If you are done with the East Wall and have already visited the Wold, travel to Elthengels, in the Norcrofts\tHestil has told you of two possible places you could go once you have completed your adventures in the East Wall: north to Langhold, in the Wold, if you have not already gone there, or north-west to Elthengels, in the Norcrofts.\n",
[6234]="7001CEF1\n1\tDefeat merrevail at Dannenglor (total: 10)\tMerrevail can be found in the Elf-ruins of Dannenglor, north of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. You should fight the merrevail in pursuit of the Malledhrim Elves who were most likely waylaid at the gates of Dannenglor.\n2\tTalk to Fernachar at the Haunted Inn\tFernachar awaits you anxiously at the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, south of Dannenglor. You should return swiftly to Fernachar and inform him of your relative success against the merrevail of Dannenglor.\n",
[6235]="70017925\n1\tBring the collected items to Dardúr at Gondamon in Ered Luin\030Collect Misty Mountain stones (total: 12)\030Collect Archivist Ánraig's runes\tThe stones can be found among the goblins of Goblin-town. The runic inscription is held by Ánraig, east of Gwaelband in the ruins of Annúminas. Dardúr wishes you to bring the stones from the roots of the Misty Mountains and a runic inscription held by an Angmarim archivist named Ánraig.\n2\tBring the collected items to Dardúr at Gondamon in Ered Luin\030Collect corroded neekerbreeker-horns (total: 10)\030Collect hooked Warg-claws (total: 20)\tNerbeglir can be found in Malenhad in Angmar. Wargs can be found in Angmar, the Misty Mountains, and Forochel. Dardúr now requires Neekerbreeker-horns and hooked Warg-claws.\n3\tBring the collected items to Dardúr at Gondamon in Ered Luin\030Collect a Sigil of War\030Collect a Rune of Winged Dominance\tGruglok may be found at Urugarth in Angmar. Azgoth and Mormoz may be found at Carn Dûm in Angmar. Dardúr now needs Gruglok's Sigil of War and a Rune of Winged Dominance.\n",
[6236]="70009988\n1\tDefeat Barkskin wood-trolls (total: 4)\030Defeat Rotting wood-trolls (total: 2)\tThe Twisted Grove lies to the south-west of the Eavespires. Angered by the wanton ruin inflicted upon his grove, Longbough has asked you to defeat the wood-trolls infesting the Twisted Grove.\n2\tFind and defeat Heart-rot\tHeart-rot is at the Twisted Grove, which lies south-west of the Eavespires. As well as driving the wood-trolls from his grove, Erchiel also asked you to find and defeat their leader, Heart-rot, in hopes that the remnant will flee.\n3\tTalk to Erchiel\tErchiel is at the Eavespires, on the north-west shore of Lake Evendim. You should return to the Eavespires and tell Erchiel of your battle with Heart-rot.\n",
[6237]="70049264\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Dor Amarth (total: 15)\tOrcs can be found around Dor Amarth. You should defeat as many Orcs as possible.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Orcs in Dor Amarth.\n",
[6238]="70047D65\n1\tDestroy hidden Orkish traps (total: 12)\tVenture into the Noman-lands with Faroth, find hidden Orkish traps, and destroy them. They can be found in the many ruins throughout the Noman-lands. Faroth must be present to find the hidden Orkish traps. If you lose track of him, use the hound-calling whistle to summon him back.\n2\tReturn to Mablung\tMablung can be found at the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. You should return to Mablung and tell him that many of the Orkish traps were destroyed.\n",
[6239]="70008661\n1\tBring the gemstone-hoard to Bothwar\030Collect the gemstone-hoard\tThe gem-hoard is near the cave-claw nests within Dolroth in southern Gorothlad, north and east of Gabilshathûr. The dwarf-miner Bothwar has asked you to retrieve a hoard of gems for him.\n",
[6240]="7000222E\n1\tBring the gold-dust back to Machar\030Collect gold-dust (total: 24)\tThe Tarkrîp are just north of Tór Gailvin -- seek out the cave they call Burzum Pushdug. Machar has asked you to collect gold from the cave of the Orcs who slew his kindred.\n",
